<title>POLAND: SPEED SKATING-SINGLE DISTANCE WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SPEED SKATING-SINGLE DISTANCE WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
